      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> applying the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>queryFunction</code></a> that defines the\nquery and its result type.",
      "translation": "返回与给定 <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 匹配且应用了定义查询及其结果类型的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>queryFunction</code></a> 的实体。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a single entity matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a> if none was found.",
      "translation": "返回与给定 <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 匹配的单条实体；若未找到，则返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the number of instances matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回与给定<a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Example</code></a>匹配的实例数量。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Checks whether the data store contains elements that match the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>.",
      "translation": "检查数据存储是否包含与给定<a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Example</code></a>匹配的项。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The query object used with <code>queryFunction</code> is only valid inside the <code>findBy(…)</code> method call. This\nrequires the query function to return a query result and not the <a href=\"FluentQuery.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>FluentQuery</code></a> object itself to ensure the\nquery is executed inside the <code>findBy(…)</code> method.",
      "translation": "与 `<code>queryFunction</code>` 一起使用的查询对象仅在 `<code>findBy(…)</code>` 方法调用内部有效。这要求查询函数返回查询结果，而不是 `<a href=\"FluentQuery.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>FluentQuery</code></a>` 对象本身，以确保查询在 `<code>findBy(…)</code>` 方法内得到执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
