      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> applying the given <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>. In case no match could be\nfound <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux.empty()</code></a> is returned.",
      "translation": "返回所有与给定<a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>匹配并应用给定<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>的实体。如果未找到任何匹配项，则返回<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux.empty()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> applying the given <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回所有与给定<a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>匹配并应用给定<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>的实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>. In case no match could be found <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux.empty()</code></a> is\nreturned.",
      "translation": "返回所有匹配给定<a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>的实体。如果未找到任何匹配项，则返回<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux.empty()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Interface to allow execution of Query by Example <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> instances using a reactive infrastructure.",
      "translation": "提供使用响应式基础设施执行基于示例（<a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>）实例查询的接口。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回所有与给定<a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Example</code></a>匹配的实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>sort</code> - the <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> specification to sort the results by, may be <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html#unsorted()\"><code>Sort.unsorted()</code></a>, must not be\n         null.",
      "translation": "<code>sort</code> - 用于对结果进行排序的 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 规范，可以是 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html#unsorted()\"><code>Sort.unsorted()</code></a>，但绝不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a single entity matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a> if none was found.",
      "translation": "返回一个与给定<a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>或<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a>匹配的单个实体，如果未找到则返回空。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</a></code> - via <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#error(java.lang.Throwable)\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.error(Throwable)</code></a> if the\n          example yields more than one result.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</a></code> - 通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#error(java.lang.Throwable)\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.error(Throwable)</code></a> 抛出，如果示例返回的结果超过一个。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
